### 10. AI Recommendation Documentation

The recommendation system analyses the user's spending information.

**Example:**

> Monthly budget = ₹10,000
> Total spending = ₹8,500
> Food spending = ₹3,500

The system may generate:

**“You have used 85% of your monthly budget. Consider reducing unnecessary food and shopping expenses to stay within your budget.”**

The recommendations should be presented as informational suggestions rather than guaranteed financial advice.

